# Tzvetan Todorov.
tm=source('todorov_memory','Tzvetan Todorov, “War: the evil that men do,” UNESCO Courier web reproduction (posted2018).','https://courier.unesco.org/en/articles/war-evil-men-do','Read complete short attributed essay, especially “An act of faith in the future.” Posting12October2018 is posthumous; no new2018authorship/contribution date inferred. Historical examples are Todorov’s ethical/memory argument, not independent event verification.')
